      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4406_Task5" name="Customer Safety/L&amp;D/HSE build the customer-safety curriculum — hazard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Safety/L&amp;D/HSE build the customer-safety curriculum — hazard awareness, daily inspection (W4393), spill/chemical response (W4397), equipment rules (W4395), incident response (W4401), first aid, crowd (W4399), vulnerable-customer (W4400)
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / L&amp;D / HSE
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / CHRO
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4406_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4406_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4406_Task6" name="L&amp;D/HSE deliver (onboarding + annual refresh + drills — fire/evacuation, spill…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: L&amp;D/HSE deliver (onboarding + annual refresh + drills — fire/evacuation, spill, first-aid, crowd), track competency/certification, and target contingent workforce too
Responsible (R): L&amp;D / HSE / Store Ops / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4406_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4406_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4406_Task7" name="Customer Safety/HSE verify competency in practice (W4407), retrain on CAPA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer Safety/HSE verify competency in practice (W4407), retrain on CAPA (W4404), and refresh on regulation/hazard change
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / HSE / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4406_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4406_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
