    <bpmn:process id="W_W4407" name="W4407. Customer-Safety Audit, Assurance &amp; Board Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Audit cycle; governance review; Board/Audit-Committee cadence
Frequency: Periodic audit + quarterly/annual Board reporting
Volume: ~205-site audit cycle + Board reporting
Owner: Internal Audit (VS-21) / Customer Safety / Governance (VS-36)
Participants: Audit (VS-21), Customer Safety, HSE (VS-24), Risk (VS-21.2), Governance (VS-36), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4407 — Customer-Safety Audit, Assurance &amp; Board Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4407_LaneSet2">
