        <bpmn:outgoing>W4407_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4407_Task4" name="Audit/Customer Safety design the assurance program — site self-audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Audit/Customer Safety design the assurance program — site self-audit, second-line HSE/Risk review, third-line Audit, and KPI/fatality/claim reporting to Board/Audit-Committee
Responsible (R): Audit / Customer Safety / Governance
Accountable (A): Audit Committee / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4407_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4407_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4407_Task5" name="Audit/Customer Safety execute the audit cycle (sample/risk-based), verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Audit/Customer Safety execute the audit cycle (sample/risk-based), verify standards-in-practice (W4386/W4393–W4400), CAPA effectiveness (W4404), and regulatory readiness (W4391)
Responsible (R): Audit / Customer Safety / HSE
Accountable (A): Audit Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4407_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4407_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4407_Task6" name="Audit/Customer Safety report KPIs (injury rate, near-miss, claim…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit/Customer Safety report KPIs (injury rate, near-miss, claim cost/frequency, CAPA closure, audit score) and severe incidents to Board/Audit-Committee, and track remediation
Responsible (R): Audit / Customer Safety / Governance
Accountable (A): Audit Committee / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Quarterly/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4407_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4407_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4407_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4407_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4407_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-673 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Incident Response, Claims &amp; Safety Analytics (PA-147.3).) | - CTL-673: three-lines assurance; independent audit; Board KPI + severe-incident reporting; remediation tracked
Owner: Internal Audit (VS-21) / Customer Safety / Governance (VS-36)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
