    <bpmn:process id="W_W4408" name="W4408. Customer-Safety Performance Analytics, Benchmarking &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; strategy review (W4385); continuous improvement
Frequency: Monthly + annual strategy
Volume: Enterprise customer-safety analytics across ~205 sites
Owner: Customer Safety / BI (VS-28) / Risk (VS-21) / OpEx (VS-133)
Participants: BI (VS-28), Risk (VS-21), Customer Safety, HSE (VS-24), Insurance (VS-26), OpEx (VS-133), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4408 — Customer-Safety Performance Analytics, Benchmarking &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4408_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4408_Lane1" name="Customer Safety">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4408_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4408_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4408_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4408_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4408_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4408_Start3" name="Reporting cycle; strategy review (W4385); continuous improvement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4408_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4408_Task4" name="Customer Safety/BI build the analytics — injury/near-miss rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Safety/BI build the analytics — injury/near-miss rate, frequency/severity, by zone/cause/site, claim cost/frequency/severity, CAPA closure/aging, audit score, leading indicators (inspection %, hazard density)
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / BI / Risk
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4408_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4408_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4408_Task5" name="Customer Safety/Risk benchmark vs retail/home-improvement industry and internal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Safety/Risk benchmark vs retail/home-improvement industry and internal prior-period, identify hotspots/trends, and feed strategy (W4385)/CAPA (W4404)/standards (W4386)
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / Risk / BI
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety
Duration: Monthly/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4408_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4408_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4408_Task6" name="Customer Safety/OpEx drive continuous improvement — eliminate repeat root…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer Safety/OpEx drive continuous improvement — eliminate repeat root causes, adopt best-practice from best-performing sites, and measure ROI of prevention investment
Responsible (R): Customer Safety / OpEx / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4408_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4408_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4408_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4408_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4408_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-673 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Incident Response, Claims &amp; Safety Analytics (PA-147.3).) | - CTL-673: leading + lagging indicators tracked; benchmarked; insights actioned via CAPA (W4404)/standards (W4386); ROI measured
Owner: Customer Safety / BI (VS-28) / Risk (VS-21) / OpEx (VS-133)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
